        \"Public vote weight = 50% since 2016 (previously jury-only until 2009)\",
        \"2023 showed record jury-public divergence: Ukraine won jury, Finland won public\",
        \"Diaspora voting and cultural proximity remain strongest predictors of point exchange\"
